# Scratch output from release verification: packed tarballs, checksums,
# fresh-home/fresh-install probe directories and probe transcripts. These
# contain absolute machine paths, which the public-safety CI job rejects in
# tracked files, so they are evidence to be read and discarded, never committed.
.release-evidence/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# SQLite sidecar files generated when a committed .db fixture is opened
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
